+## Sites
+
+Set `X-Larder-Site` to a site ID; when omitted it defaults to `main`.
+An unknown site returns HTTP 400 with code `unknown_site`. Stock, batches,
+cooking, alerts and stock-takes are limited to the selected site. Items,
+suppliers, recipes and dishes are shared. Receiving an order requires a
+location in the selected site.
+
